  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the slopes of all possible chords of the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo></math> which passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and also divide the circumference of this circle into two arcs whose lengths are in the ratio&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1,</mn></math> is equal to",
